  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ephuma ethempelini, omunye wabafundi bakhe wathi kuye: Mfundisi, khangela amatshe anjani lezakhiwo ezinjani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wathi kuye: Uyabona lezizakhiwo ezinkulu na? Kakuyikusala ilitshe elilodwa phezu kwelinye elingayikudilizelwa phansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esehlezi entabeni ethiwa iOliveti maqondana lethempeli uPetro loJakobe loJohane loAndreya bambuza bebodwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bathi: Sitshele ukuba lokhu kuzakuba nini, lokuba isibonakaliso sizakuba yini, lapho sekuzakwenzakala lezizinto zonke na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwang’khona uJesu eqala ukuthi kubo: Qaphelani lingaduhiswa muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanengi bazakuza ngebizo lami besithi: Nginguye; baduhise abanengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa nxa lisizwa ngezimpi lamahungahunga ezimpi, lingethuki; kufanele kwenzeke, kodwa ukuphela kuzabe kungakafiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba isizwe sizakuvukela isizwe, lombuso uvukele umbuso; kube khona ukuzamazama komhlaba indawo ngendawo, kube khona indlala; lezizinto ziyikuqala komhelo wesikhathi esizayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa qaphelani lina. Bazakulinikela emiphakathini; lizakutshaywa emasinagogeni; lizakumiswa phambi kwababusi ngenxa yami, kube yibufakazi kubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.17+MAT.10.18+MAT.10.19+MAT.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:17–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 12:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ivangeli limele ukutshunyayelwa kuzo zonke izizwe kuqala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa belidonsela ekuthoniseni, belinikela, lingakhathaleli ngaphambili elizakukukhuluma, kodwa lokhu elizakukunikwa ngalesosikhathi, kukhulumeni; ngoba kakusini elikhulumayo kodwa uMoya oNgcwele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu uzakunikela umfowabo ekufeni loyise umntanakhe, labantwana bazakuvukela abazali, bababulale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakuzondwa yibo bonke ngenxa yebizo lami, kodwa ophikelelayo kuze kube sekupheleni nguye ozakusiliswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa nxa libona amanyala encithakalo emi lapho angafanele khona — ofundayo kaqedisise — kung’khona labo abaseJudiya kababalekele entabeni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ophezu kwendlu angehli, angangeni ukuthatha ulutho endlini yakhe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lowo osemasimini angabuyeli emuva ukuyathatha ingubo yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maye kwabakhulelweyo labamunyisayo ngalezonsuku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulekani ukuba kungabi ebusika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngalezonsuku kuzakuba khona ukuhlupheka okungazanga kube khona ekuqaleni kokudabuka okwadatshulwa nguNkulunkulu kuze kube khathesi, lokungasayikuba khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isam 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba iNkosi ibingazifinyezanga insuku, bekungesiliswe muntu; kodwa izifinyezile ngenxa yabakhethiweyo ebakhethileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kung’khonake nxa umuntu esithi kini: Khangelani, nangu uKristu; ingabe: Khangelani, nanguyana; lingakholwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzavela okristu bamanga labaprofethi bamanga, benze izibonakaliso lezimangaliso, ukuze kuthi nxa kungenzeka baduhise abakhethiweyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa qaphelani lina; sengilitshelile konke ngaphambili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
